Otherwise the result is `max` characters long, ending in `…`.\n- For `max` of 0 or less, it returns `''`, since there's no room for even the ellipsis.\n\nI checked a few cases by hand: `truncate('hello world', 5)` gives `'hell…'`, `truncate('hi', 5)` gives `'hi'`, and `truncate('hello', 1)` gives `'…'`.\n\nLength is counted in JavaScript string units (UTF-16 code units). `…` is one unit, so the output length is exact for ordinary text. Text with emoji or other astral characters can split a surrogate pair at the cut point. Tell me if you need grapheme-aware truncation.\n\nI did not add tests or commit anything.","ttft_ms":1645,"type":"result","duration_ms":8604,"uuid":"fbb25866-1662-4e03-ba08-3ebc71a49d5a","ttft_stream_ms":1307,"time_to_request_ms":444,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":6,"system_prompt":349,"resume_other":1,"process_user_input":3,"input_attachments":15,"input_hooks":2,"conversation_append":0,"tool_pool_refresh":2,"init_message":4,"init_frame_send":3,"engine_pickup":1,"loop_entry":4,"message_prep":2,"model_config_wait":14,"autocompact":2,"request_announcements":4,"query_setup":1,"model_gates":1,"tool_schema_build":17,"message_normalization":3,"client_creation":2,"request_build":8},"turn_start_resume_kind":"none","process_turn_index":0,"time_to_request_loop_lag_ms":14,"time_to_request_cpu_ms":131,"time_to_request_major_faults":0,"process_rss_mib_turn_start":204,"process_anon_mib_turn_start":126,"process_rss_mib_result":229,"process_anon_mib_result":137,"process_peak_rss_mib":234,"process_cpu_ms_turn":761,"process_wall_ms_turn":8604,"tool_pool_build_count":3,"tool_pool_build_lapsed_count":0,"tool_pool_moved_at_lapse_count":0,"tool_pool_limit_ms":30000,"process_cpu_ms_streaming":279,"process_wall_ms_streaming":5136,"main_stream_count":4,"main_stream_event_count":187,"main_stream_chunk_count":148,"process_turn_states":{"main_stream":{"cpu_ms":279,"wall_ms":5136,"entries":4},"tool":{"cpu_ms":70,"wall_ms":294,"entries":3},"first_event_wait":{"cpu_ms":218